WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,110
Tomorrow at the earliest

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:03,420
Isn’t that why I still can’t drink today?

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:05,820
That's not necessarily the case

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,460
I should have known he was going to move

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,540
So I stocked up on two items in advance, Brother Jin.

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,740
At the critical moment, it will be you and me.

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,100
Brother Jin, we also have no problem with a bottle of fifty

8
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:18,930
The boss only sold it for thirty

9
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,970
Are you a human being if you just go up to 20?

10
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,650
Things are rare and valuable, so why not?

11
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:41,950
Who in the morning
